"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le01ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: When people feel threatened, they act out. When you take a breath, your heart opens and you listen without judgement.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That is so true. I know she must be traumatized by something. I don't want to have to fire her.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You've got to do what you've got to do. The raise is good news! Does Bill know about the letter?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not yet. When someone lies outright like that, it gets my back up. I mean there is no way I would ever serve anybody raw chicken. When I see him again, I will not be able to keep my mouth shut! I have half a mind to call him out.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: For the sake of your own well-being, I think you will have to keep a lid on it.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "44000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know you're right. I have no real intention of saying anything, but it hurts to be lied\nabout.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The customer is always right! When someone has their heart set on something, they cannot be stopped!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Umm sorry what do you mean, Pete?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think that the customer complained with the aim of hurting someone. He was frustrated with his own issues, even though, yes, of course when you order something and the restaurant runs out of it, it's frustrating, but he must have anger issues.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le01ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "74000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wholeheartedly agree, but RAW chicken? He says he'll come to the restaurant to see me in person when he's in town next week.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: I know you offer great service at your restaurant, besides the incident with Rachel. If you want to provide the best service, you'll probably have to tell Rachel to get some help and take a break at least. You can't be held accountable for someone else's mental health issues in the workplace. You've also had a lot of repeat business. I think everything is going to be just fine.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le01ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn11le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}